        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Group">
            <English>Group</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Group_ToolTip">
            <English>The nearest AI groups to where you dropped the module.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Mode">
            <English>Intent</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Mode_ToolTip">
            <English>Free: react, then go home. Hold: stay on this spot. Defend: stay and counterattack inside the radius. Attack: take this position. Reserve: wait for the Director to release you.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Paused">
            <English>AI paused</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Paused_ToolTip">
            <English>Stops every squad tactic within the frame and the planners until resumed. The men still shoot back.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Posture">
            <English>Posture</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Posture_ToolTip">
            <English>Cautious groups break contact early and never assault; aggressive ones close and press.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Radius">
            <English>Radius (m)</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Radius_ToolTip">
            <English>How far from the objective the group may roam on its own.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Reinforcements">
            <English>Reinforcements left</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Reinforcements_ToolTip">
            <English>Sets the side's remaining reinforcement budget: releases of a reserve, counterattacks included.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_ReleaseRadius">
            <English>Area radius (m)</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_ReleaseRadius_ToolTip">
            <English>The reserve gets this area as a suspected contact, never a position.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_hostis_Zeus_Dialog_Side">
